  "rationales": {"U":"原文使用模糊动词'provides'和主观修饰语'required to properly interpret'，未说明提供方式（如附录？嵌入？）、范围（'all terms'是否含 domain-specific terms？）、格式（定义结构是否标准化？），导致读者无法确定该节是否满足其理解需求；证据片段：'provides the definitions of all terms, acro nyms, and abbreviations required to p roperly interpret the SRS'","A":"'all terms, acro nyms, and abbreviations'存在拼写错误（'acro nyms'含空格、'p roperly'含空格）且未界定'acronyms'与'abbreviations'的区分规则，违反术语一致性原则；证据片段：'acro nyms'和'p roperly'中的异常空格","C":"该需求描述的是文档组织惯例而非系统行为或约束，不直接涉及功能/非功能正确性，但隐含承诺——若SRS中实际缺失某必需术语定义，则该需求失效；证据片段：'required to p roperly interpret the SRS'表明其为必要条件，但未指定判定'properly interpret'的客观标准，故正确性依赖外部解释","V":"无可观测输出或验收准则：无法通过测试确认'provides'是否完成、'all'是否穷尽、'required'是否被识别；证据片段：'provides the definitions of all terms...'——缺少可验证的交付物形态、检查方法或通过标准"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"The SRS SHALL include a dedicated section titled 'Glossary' (Appendix A) that lists every term, acronym, and abbreviation used in this document, each accompanied by a precise, one-sentence definition.","A":"The SRS SHALL include a dedicated section titled 'Glossary' (Appendix A) that lists every term, acronym, and abbreviation used in this document, each accompanied by a precise, one-sentence definition. Acronyms are initialisms formed from the initial letters of a multi-word name and pronounced as a word (e.g., 'RADAR'); abbreviations are shortened forms of words or phrases (e.g., 'vs.' for 'versus').","C":"保持不变","V":"The Glossary (Appendix A) SHALL contain exactly one entry for each unique term, acronym, or abbreviation appearing in Sections 1–5 of this SRS; each entry SHALL consist of the exact string as used in those sections, followed by a single-sentence definition; the completeness of the Glossary SHALL be verified by automated string matching against all non-comment tokens in Sections 1–5."},
